<!--
    DTD = Document Type Definition

    DTD defines the legal structure of an XML document.

    Syntax:
    <!ELEMENT element-name (child-elements)>

    #PCDATA = Parsed Character Data
    It means the element contains normal text.
-->

<!ELEMENT student (name, roll, department)>

<!ELEMENT name (#PCDATA)>
<!ELEMENT roll (#PCDATA)>
<!ELEMENT department (#PCDATA)>

<!--PCDATA means : The name element can contain normal text data. -->